    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41654" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχορηγ-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>supply, provision,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐ. γενομένης ἐκ τῶν ἱερῶν
					προσόδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					818.9
				</span></i>
			 (Ephesus, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶν
				τὸ σῶμα..συμβιβαζόμενον διὰ πάσης ἁφῆς τῆς
				ἐπιχορηγίας,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ πασῶν τῶν ἐπιχορηγουσῶν
					ἁφῶν</span>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχορηγέω</span> fin.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τῆς ἐ. τοῦ πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
					1.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
